      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ACE TEN (4) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when fifth at Taree Super Track over 300m behind Hot Suspect (17.71) in a Grade 5. Can make amends. FLYING SAUCER (2) comes off an average run last start when eighth at this track over 400m behind Kicker Zoom (23.54) in a Grade 5. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Worth another chance. DIVE RIGHT IN (6) showed good early burn but run over late to finish 7th at Taree Super Track in Grade 5 company. Should be about the mark. BIG BOY CHEVY (1) is new to this course but not to be underestimated.",
